                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                        "entry_id": "a8809002-1474-366e-aaaf-b4007c2fa42a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "das ganze Drum und Dran; alles, was dazu gehört; das Übliche, das Gewöhnliche, das Althergebrachte"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d76c0af6-da4b-4649-a7b9-43159b15b048",
                                "sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                                "text": "Die Hochzeit wurde in großem Stil gefeiert, mit allem Pipapo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1abada67-a4e1-47f9-ae95-2ee0c46b5b12",
                                "sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                                "text": "Und das übliche Pipapo, Sie wissen schon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "437f0341-96cb-4760-a811-752ea9881701",
                                "sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                                "text": "„Das größte Geschenk war vorne an den Kurbeltisch gelehnt, eine Carrerabahn für Volker und mich, mit Autos und Kurven und allem Pipapo.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a51c412-d30f-4f9c-9f3d-b31eb954b7bd",
                                "sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                                "text": "Kindergeburtstage können mit allem Pipapo gefeiert werden und Autos können mit allem Pipapo ausgestattet sein."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bc19a61-d729-45ea-88a0-f37f2343f70b",
                                "sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                                "text": "„Sie schicken den Bericht mit FedEx. Samt Röntgenbildern und allem Pipapo.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1861bfc-078f-4b8e-9b56-a98bf72b2243",
                        "source_entry_id": "a8809002-1474-366e-aaaf-b4007c2fa42a",
                        "source_sense_id": "e14d3b66-a320-3a2d-8bd9-981ab452aa79",
                        "target_lang_word": "trappings",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trappings",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d8feb15-ba1f-3075-ac45-f955f059bbfa",
                                        "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clothing or equipment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a6b37ab-7d46-4658-b975-1e8ff3f90442",
                                                "sense_id": "8d8feb15-ba1f-3075-ac45-f955f059bbfa",
                                                "text": "He went through his belongings, gradually shedding the trappings of youth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                        "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which gives the appearance of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b59988b4-368e-4670-9089-7a0f3eefd52a",
                                                "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                                "text": "Whether any of the relatives of the seamen whose names appeared there were now among the congregation, I knew not; but so many are the unrecorded accidents in the fishery, and so plainly did several women present wear the countenance if not the trappings of some unceasing grief, that I feel sure that here before me were assembled those, in whose unhealing hearts the sight of those bleak tablets sympathetically caused the old wounds to bleed afresh."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c29ebc57-058b-437d-8ea2-4bd643ebf928",
                                                "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                                "text": "Two years on, and while the Sultan of Slowjamastan has instigated more than a few bizarre laws (he’s outlawed the wearing of Crocs, for example), the Republic also has all the trappings of a fledgling nation-state. It issues its own passports, flies its own flag, prints its own currency (“the duble”), and has a national anthem that’s played on state occasions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a45e77b-57a7-4b88-8451-70425786fb87",
                                                "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                                "text": "The second half was not a siege of the England goal but it had the trappings of it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6c4935e-93ef-301d-a266-82ae4d829436",
                                        "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ornamental coverings or harnesses for a horse; caparisons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trappings",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bfbce03-af8f-3d3d-856f-aca167e830ea",
